<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hadco Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hadco Corp started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of Hadco Corp as a intermediate-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>Earlier today Hadco said it had started a public offering 2.3 million shares at $56.875 per share.</p>
<p>Hadco shares were up 2-1/16 to 59-1/16.</p>
</text>
